        },
        "description": "Historical weekly evidence for GBP 200 UK transfers to Spain, the United States, India, Pakistan and the Philippines. Uses each provider’s latest usable result per UTC day. Price gaps require at least two verified non-promotional bank-to-bank offers captured within one hour; they are observed offer differences, not costs against a mid-market rate."
      },
      "response": []
    }
